{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18295","headline":"送陆歙州傪 · 韩愈","name":"送陆歙州傪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我衣之华兮，我佩之光。\n陆君之去兮，谁与翺翔。\n敛此大惠兮，施於一州。\n今其去矣，胡不爲留。\n我作此诗，歌於远道。\n无疾其驱，天子有诏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}